src/brigadier.rs: Brigadier 1.3.10 core, translated to Rust
----------------------------------------------------------
The command dispatcher, string reader, command tree, context/chain model, suggestion model and
the primitive argument types in src/brigadier.rs are a Rust translation of com.mojang.brigadier,
the command library Mojang Studios ships with Minecraft Java 1.21.1. No Java source is
committed, vendored or redistributed here; the translation is the only form present.

